# Pre-flight (Oisha-OS)

To'liq qo'llanma (yagona manba): @.claude/skills/preflight/SKILL.md

`AGENTS.md` qoidasi: **pre-flight qizil bo'lsa — PR yo'q.**

Python core (har doim, repo ildizidan):

```bash
ruff check --select F821 src/
bandit -r src/ -ll -x src/services/debug/ --quiet
bandit -r src/ -ll
SKIP_LIVE=1 python -m pytest -q --tb=short
```

TS workspace'lar faqat o'zgarganda: root (`pnpm run typecheck/lint/test/build`),
`salescoach-ai/` (`pnpm run type-check/test/build`) — ikkalasi alohida, faqat `pnpm`.

Natija: har bo'lim uchun ✅/❌. ❌ bo'lsa push yo'q. Testni o'chirib/skip qilib yashil qilish taqiqlanadi.
Hech qachon `python src/main.py` / userbot'ni lokal ishga tushirmang, `.env` / `*.session` ni o'qimang.
